msgid "Making main screen plugins"
msgstr "制作主屏幕插件"

msgid "What this tutorial covers"
msgstr "本教程涵盖的内容"

msgid ""
"Main screen plugins allow you to create new UIs in the central part of the "
"editor, which appear next to the \"2D\", \"3D\", \"Script\", \"Game\", and "
"\"AssetLib\" buttons. Such editor plugins are referred as \"Main screen "
"plugins\"."
msgstr ""
"主屏幕插件允许你在编辑器的中心部分创建新的 UI，这些 UI 显示"
"在“2D”、“3D”、“Script”和“AssetLib”按钮旁边。这类编辑器插件被称为“主屏幕插"
"件”。"

msgid ""
"This tutorial leads you through the creation of a basic main screen plugin. "
"For the sake of simplicity, our main screen plugin will contain a single "
"button that prints text to the console."
msgstr ""
"本教程将带领你创建一个基本的主屏幕插件。为了简单起见，我们的主屏幕插件将仅包"
"含一个打印文本到控制台的按钮。"

msgid "Initializing the plugin"
msgstr "初始化插件"

msgid ""
"First create a new plugin from the Plugins menu. For this tutorial, we'll "
"put it in a folder called ``main_screen``, but you can use any name you'd "
"like."
msgstr ""
"首先从插件菜单中创建一个新插件。在本教程中，我们将把它放在一个名为 "
"``main_screen`` 的文件夹中，但你可以使用任何你喜欢的名字。"

msgid ""
"The plugin script will come with ``_enter_tree()`` and ``_exit_tree()`` "
"methods, but for a main screen plugin we need to add a few extra methods. "
"Add four extra methods such that the script looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"插件脚本默认会自带 ``_enter_tree()`` 和 ``_exit_tree()`` 这两个方法，但如果是"
"制作主屏幕插件，我们还需要额外添加几个方法。请再补充四个方法，让最终的脚本看"
"起来像这样："

msgid ""
"The important part in this script is the ``_has_main_screen()`` function, "
"which is overridden to return ``true``. This function is automatically "
"called by the editor on plugin activation, to tell it that this plugin adds "
"a new center view to the editor. For now, we'll leave this script as-is and "
"we'll come back to it later."
msgstr ""
"该脚本中的关键部分是 ``_has_main_screen()`` 函数，该函数已被重写，使其返回 "
"``true`` 。当插件激活时，编辑器会自动调用此函数，以通知编辑器该插件为编辑器新"
"增了一个中心视图。目前，我们暂不修改此脚本，稍后会再次处理它。"

msgid "Main screen scene"
msgstr "主屏幕场景"

msgid ""
"Create a new scene with a root node derived from ``Control`` (for this "
"example plugin, we'll make the root node a ``CenterContainer``). Select this "
"root node, and in the viewport, click the ``Layout`` menu and select ``Full "
"Rect``. You also need to enable the ``Expand`` vertical size flag in the "
"inspector. The panel now uses all the space available in the main viewport."
msgstr ""
"创建一个新的场景，其根节点由 ``Control`` 派生而来（在这个示例插件中，我们将使"
"根节点为 ``CenterContainer``\\ ）。选择这个根节点，在视口中，点击\\ ``视口"
"``\\ 菜单，选择\\ ``整个矩形``\\ 。你还需要在检查器中启用 ``Expand`` 垂直尺寸"
"标志。面板现在将使用主视口中的所有可用空间。"

msgid ""
"Next, let's add a button to our example main screen plugin. Add a ``Button`` "
"node, and set the text to \"Print Hello\" or similar. Add a script to the "
"button like this:"
msgstr ""
"接下来，让我们为我们的主屏幕插件示例添加一个按钮。添加一个 ``Button`` 节点，"
"并将文本设置为“Print Hello”或类似的内容。给按钮添加一个脚本，像这样："

msgid ""
"Then connect the \"pressed\" signal to itself. If you need help with "
"signals, see the :ref:`doc_signals` article."
msgstr ""
"然后将“pressed”信号连接到自身。如果你需要信号方面的帮助，请参考"
"\\ :ref:`doc_signals`\\ 一文。"

msgid ""
"We are done with the main screen panel. Save the scene as "
"``main_panel.tscn``."
msgstr "我们完成了主屏幕面板。将场景保存为 ``main_panel.tscn``\\ 。"

msgid "Update the plugin script"
msgstr "更新插件脚本"

msgid ""
"We need to update the ``main_screen_plugin.gd`` script so the plugin "
"instantiates our main panel scene and places it where it needs to be. Here "
"is the full plugin script:"
msgstr ""
"我们需要更新 ``main_screen_plugin.gd`` 脚本，以便该插件能够实例化我们的主面板"
"场景并将其放置到正确的位置。以下是完整的插件脚本："

msgid ""
"A couple of specific lines were added. ``MainPanel`` is a constant that "
"holds a reference to the scene, and we instantiate it into "
"``main_panel_instance``."
msgstr ""
"新增了若干特定代码行。 ``MainPanel`` 是一个常量，用于持有对场景的引用，我们将"
"其实例化为 ``main_panel_instance`` 。"

msgid ""
"The ``_enter_tree()`` function is called before ``_ready()``. This is where "
"we instantiate the main panel scene, and add them as children of specific "
"parts of the editor. We use ``EditorInterface.get_editor_main_screen()`` to "
"obtain the main editor screen and add our main panel instance as a child to "
"it. We call the ``_make_visible(false)`` function to hide the main panel so "
"it doesn't compete for space when first activating the plugin."
msgstr ""
"在调用 ` ``_ready()`` ` 之前先调用 ` ``_enter_tree()`` ` 函数。在此处，我们实"
"例化主面板场景，并将其作为子元素添加到编辑器的特定部分中。我们使用 ` "
"``EditorInterface.get_editor_main_screen()`` ` 获取主编辑器界面，然后将主面板"
"实例作为子元素添加到该界面中。最后，调用 ` ``_make_visible (false)`` ` 函数隐"
"藏主面板，以避免在首次激活插件时因界面空间冲突而产生问题。"

msgid ""
"The ``_exit_tree()`` function is called when the plugin is deactivated. If "
"the main screen still exists, we call ``queue_free()`` to free the instance "
"and remove it from memory."
msgstr ""
"当插件停用时，将调用 ``_exit_tree()`` 函数。如果主屏幕仍然存在，我们将调用 "
"``queue_free()`` 来释放实例，并将其从内存中移除。"

msgid ""
"The ``_make_visible()`` function is overridden to hide or show the main "
"panel as needed. This function is automatically called by the editor when "
"the user clicks on the main viewport buttons at the top of the editor."
msgstr ""
"可重写 ``_make_visible()`` 函数以根据需要隐藏或显示主面板。当用户点击编辑器顶"
"部的主视口按钮时，编辑器会自动调用该函数。"

msgid ""
"The ``_get_plugin_name()`` and ``_get_plugin_icon()`` functions control the "
"displayed name and icon for the plugin's main viewport button."
msgstr ""
"``_get_plugin_name()`` 和 ``_get_plugin_icon()`` 函数控制插件主视口按钮的显示"
"名称和图标。"

msgid ""
"Another function you can add is the ``_handles()`` function, which allows "
"you to handle a node type, automatically focusing the main screen when the "
"type is selected. This is similar to how clicking on a 3D node will "
"automatically switch to the 3D viewport."
msgstr ""
"您还可以添加的另一个功能是 ``_handles()`` 功能，该功能允许您处理特定节点类型"
"——当选择该类型时，系统将自动切换至主屏幕。这类似于点击 3D 节点后会自动切换到 "
"3D 视图的操作方式。"

msgid "Main screen icons"
msgstr "主屏幕图标"

msgid ""
"You can either use one of the built-in icons from the editor, or provide "
"your own icon for the main screen plugin. In both cases, this is done by "
"overriding the ``_get_plugin_icon()`` method in the plugin script."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用编辑器中内置的图标之一，或为主屏幕插件自定义图标；无论采用哪种方"
"式，均需通过重写插件脚本中的 ` ``_get_plugin_icon()`` ` 方法来实现。"

msgid ""
"To use a built-in icon, copy an icon name from the `Godot editor icons "
"<https://godotengine.github.io/editor-icons/>`__ website. Use the name "
"copied from the website as the *first* parameter of "
"``EditorInterface.get_editor_theme().get_icon()`` (the second parameter "
"should remain ``\"EditorIcons\"``)."
msgstr ""
"如需使用内置图标，请从 `Godot editor icons <https://godotengine.github.io/"
"editor-icons/>`__ 官方网站复制图标名称。请将从网站复制的名称作为 "
"``EditorInterface.get_editor_theme().get_icon()`` 的 *第一个* 参数（第二个参"
"数应保持为 ``\"EditorIcons\"``）。"

msgid ""
"You can use a custom icon by returning something such as ``preload(\"res://"
"addons/main_screen/icon.svg\")``. When designing your own icon, you should "
"follow the same guidelines as for node icons (SVG format recommended, 16×16 "
"size). See :ref:`doc_editor_icons` for information on how to create icons "
"for your plugin."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过返回诸如 ``preload(“res://addons/main_screen/icon.svg”)``. 等内容来"
"使用自定义图标。在设计自定义图标时，应遵循与节点图标相同的使用规范（推荐采用 "
"SVG 格式，尺寸为 16×16 像素）。有关如何为您的插件创建图标的信息，请参"
"阅 :ref:`doc_editor_icons` 。"

msgid "Try the plugin"
msgstr "试试这个插件"

msgid ""
"Activate the plugin in the Project Settings. You'll observe a new button "
"next to 2D, 3D, Script above the main viewport. Clicking it will take you to "
"your new main screen plugin, and the button in the middle will print text."
msgstr ""
"在项目设置中激活插件。你会观察到主视口上方的 2D、3D、脚本旁边有一个新的按钮。"
"点击它将带你进入新的主屏幕插件，点击中间的按钮将打印文本。"

msgid ""
"If you would like to try a finished version of this plugin, check out the "
"plugin demos here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/"
"master/plugins"
msgstr ""
"如果你想试试这个插件的完成版，请在这里查看插件演示：https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/plugins"

msgid ""
"If you would like to see a more complete example of what main screen plugins "
"are capable of, check out the 2.5D demo projects here: https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/misc/2.5d"
msgstr ""
"如果你想看一个更完整的例子，了解主屏幕插件的能力，请看这里的 2.5D 演示项目："
"https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/misc/2.5d"
